Tags:		gpgme  encryption 
Comments:       GPGME (GnuPG Made Easy) is a C language library that allows
		to add support for cryptography to a program.
		It is designed to make access to public key crypto engines
		like GnuPG or GpgSM easier for applications.
		GPGME provides a high-level crypto API for encryption,
		decryption, signing, signature verification and key management
